      "message": "fix(xtask): end a silent gate step by itself and name it (STALL row)\n\nThe gate watches each step. A step whose process tree writes no output\nfor 15 minutes (60 for --release and --ignored steps;\nCAMCRAFT_GATE_STALL_MIN overrides) is killed as a tree. The gate prints\nSTALL <m>min <step> with the last lines and the live processes, records\na STALL row, goes on, and exits 3 when only STALL rows are red.\n\npost-merge.yml: the batch step has timeout-minutes 45 (the job cap of\n90 stays), and the summary step marks a timeout. The report script\ntreats a STALL row or a timeout with no FAIL row as a runner stall: one\nwarning, no \"main is red\" issue. AGENTS.md gets the rule \"Runner stops\";\nthe gate and runners skills name the variable and the row.\n\nFixes #3303\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
